{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_02_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_02",
  "title": "Thick Versus Thin",
  "storyCode": "RI-2",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7d9eb47946c6259831b6c0aea3dbca21ee7785c5cbcf335a427093b6d067e045",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Gyuh! That... That reaper's whirlwind... And that hairclip... Y-you're Gavial!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "The one and only!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Damn it. Just our luck, running into you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "But don't get ahead of yourself, Gavial! Not even you could shake our faith in thick tails!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "Yeah, you're such hot shit! Keep running!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "Doctor, let's move. I can sort them out the next time I see them."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "Gavial, how come you let them go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "You used to chase down every last person in a fight and beat them until they saw stars."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "Yeah. I used to do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "But nah, now I just think they're kind of cute. Right, Doctor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "No idea what you're saying, but I agree.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Might sound strange coming from me, but this place is full of nothing but boneheads."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Ah, whatever. Have to think all the goddamn time outside. I almost miss it here."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Hey, Doctor, don't tell me you're a thick tail lover?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "'Cause we're not gonna see eye-to-eye on that!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Cuter than you breaking them in half.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Hah! Well, thinking they're cute won't stop me beating the tar outta them."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "They're not... uh... what's the word...? Mutually exclusive!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial... you really have changed."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Mm? Hold on, Tomimi, you little brat."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Eh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "I go away for a couple years and I come back to find your tail's even fatter."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Wh-wh-whuh?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Gonna try and tell me you're with thick tails, too?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "No no no no! It's not like I wanted it to grow so thick!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "*Whimper* I want a nice, thin tail just like Gavial's..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Well, shucks. *Clicks tongue* What a poor kid you are."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Though watching you fight back there, your Arts are pretty strong now, huh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "R... Really?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Yeah. Come over to Rhodes Island and be an operator. Should be no problem for you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Ope... rator?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Operators are, uh... Well, I guess it's a job. Like me, I'm a Medic Operator."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "I remember you were still learning from the shamans when I left, right?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Yep! I've been disciplining myself every day for you, Gavial, so one day you'd come back!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "For me?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Oh... um, by that, I mean, for when you come back so I could help you out! Like I did just now!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Well, damn. You really did help out, then. Well done."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Eheheh... I love when you compliment me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Cool. Let's keep moving then. Do I remember the Temple's just ahead?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Mm-hm."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Eunectes has to be the Great Chief, c'mon. Look at how strong the whole tribe is."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Yeah, and she's top of the pile. Everyone said if not Gavial, then Eunectes, and now Gavial's gone..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Hey, over there!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "No way... Gavial?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Hey, Gavial! You're finally back!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Whoa! Long time no see, huh!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Hey, that feather on your waist is nice! Where'd it come from?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Traded one of my weapons to Inam for it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Man, your tribe really has it good. Inam can get her hands on anything. I wish I could be with you guys too."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Too bad. Inam hates crowds. But if there's anything you guys want, you can go through me!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Deal! ...Hey. Look over there."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Is that... wait, it's Gavial!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "She's actually back?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Gavial! So you weren't dead!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Alive and well, baby!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Brother, come on. Stop trying to make a show. You've got the Stone Disease and all. Just go back home and lie down, okay?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Who cares! What's a little disease in the face of the ceremony?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "A little disease is still disease! And think about how bad it'd be for us if you went out there and showed everyone the rocks growing on your tail!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Look, Gavial might be gone, but now Zumama's sure to be the next Great Chief!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "That's the part I care about! I need to witness the moment Zumama becomes Chief!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Damnit, I should have listened to Zumama... huh? Brother, look over there!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "It couldn't be. Is that... Gavial?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Has she come back to become Great Chief?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "...I'm sorry, but now I HAVE to see the ceremony."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Yeah. I don't think anyone can miss this now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Huh? Those two look like they're from the Eunectes tribe..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "It really is Gavial! You're finally back!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "I always believed in you, Gavial!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Hey, everyone, look! It's Gavial!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Gavial! Gavial! Gavial!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Whew, what a rowdy bunch... Looks like we oughta pick up the pace."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Mm-hm! Everyone loves the ceremony, after all. And everyone loves Gavial too!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Oh. Gavial, look at that sign there."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Lemme see. Tch, goddamned scratchy handwriting... Oh, look at that. It says 'Mahuizzotia.'"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "We're here."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Wait. What gives with the music?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "And for that matter, why do I recognize it..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Wait! Doctor, this is an AUS song, isn't it?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Definitely.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Well, damn."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "I'm not totally sure myself, but I've definitely heard people playing this before."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Snap out of it, Doctor! Don't just walk in!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Is it?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Lots of AUS fans at Rhodes Island. That's gotta be it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Ah. Yep, this is an AUS song."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "How do you know what AUS is?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Around this time last year, a bunch of strange people calling themselves AUS came here from the outside."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "They held a concert at Inam's tribe first. After that, a whole lot of Tiacauh started treating them like heralds of the Mahuizzotia."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Huh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Later on, they were asked to stay for a long performance in the Temple surroundings."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "I got to hear them once. Their music really was powerful, and beautiful... you could feel their awesome Arts, too."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Ever since, lots of Tiacauh fell in love with this kind of music."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "And then suddenly one day, they disappeared. Everyone said they'd gone back to their ancestors' embrace."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "But I knew they'd only left, same as Gavial had."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "The music playing right now should be coming from those 'speaker' things they left here. I think they also left behind some of their albums?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Speakers?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Yep. They need Arts to function, so only priests and shamans can actually use them, and most of them are in Inam's tribe."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Hahaha! Now that's a band of freewheelers."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Can't deny, their songs really get up in there. I haven't even stepped in and they've got my blood running hot. I think I'm beginning to like them!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Let's go, Doctor! We're gonna hear some music and enjoy a hell of a show!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "aliases": [
        "Gavial"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "aliases": [
        "Tomimi"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
